No Distribution

Beyond the copy your table uses, you may not publish, distribute, share,
sublicense or otherwise make the software, or any changes or new works based
on it, available to anyone else, whether as source code, as built files or
as a hosted service. This includes publishing a fork or a changed version on
GitHub or anywhere else. GitHub's Terms of Service let you view and fork this
repository within GitHub; that fork must stay unused outside these terms and
must not be published with your changes.

